# (the user's, 2026-11-22) Setup's KNOB 4 is Values (from the Set page; Save gone: GLO held saves); the Set page's
# KNOB 4 is Load: a stored set chosen and loaded from the FM-1 itself. A click a stored set (the empty numbers
# skipped, stopping at the first and the last), the big ring showing the set; resting on it 1.2 s, the question a load
# from the computer asks (LOAD SET n? <name>: GLO yes, anything else no, 30 s), its yes loading it as APPLY's does
# (the pieces, the list, saved: it survives a reboot), STATUS the same as after the computer's. Only while stopped:
# playing, a turn says STOP FIRST and nothing is asked; no set stored: it says so. The screen reader's lines.
listen
wait 600
tap PLAY
wait 400
expect playing 0
# (the sets the FM-1 comes with, stored at its first boot: deleted, an empty store as this test was made for)
setsdelete
expect setmask 0
# Setup: Tune, MIDI out, Lights, Values (no Save); Values on KNOB 4, the same setting as ever (saved, global)
tap GLO
wait 600
expect view 6
said Setup page: Tune 0, MIDI out On, Lights On, Values Peek
expect values 0
spin K4 1
wait 300
said Values Always
expect values 1
expect peek 1
shot setup_values.png
spin K4 -1
wait 300
said Values Peek
expect values 0
# the Set page with no set stored: Load says so, asks nothing
tap GLO
wait 600
expect view 28
said Set page, the pieces, 1 of 8, Basic: Mode Endless, Transition LP, only in Set mode, Store, set 1, Load, no sets stored
shot load_none_rest.png
spin K4 1
wait 200
said Load, no sets stored
msgis NO SETS STORED
expect bigring 1
expect loadset 0
shot load_none.png
wait 1500
expect asking 0
expect outcome 0
# three sets stored from the computer, with gaps: set 2 (Echospace 12, five pieces), set 4 (Night Set, eight), set 7
# (Three, three; no GLOB)
name -1 Echospace 12
dub1set build/scenarios/loadknob/five.dub1 5
name 0 Dawn
name -1 Night Set
dub1set build/scenarios/loadknob/eight.dub1 8
name 0 -
name -1 Three
dub1set build/scenarios/loadknob/three.dub1 3 noglob
name -1 -
setsend 1 build/scenarios/loadknob/five.dub1
wait 100
tap GLO
wait 100
setstate yes
wait 3200
setsend 3 build/scenarios/loadknob/eight.dub1
wait 100
tap GLO
wait 100
setstate yes
wait 3200
setsend 6 build/scenarios/loadknob/three.dub1
wait 100
tap GLO
wait 100
setstate yes
wait 3200
expect outcome 0
expect view 28
expectname 0 Basic
expect setlen 0
# Load at rest: "3 sets", the stored numbers lit among the eight
tap GLO
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 600
expect view 28
said only in Set mode, Store, set 1, Load, 3 sets stored
shot load_rest.png
# a click a stored set: 2, 4 (3 skipped), 7 (5 and 6 skipped), then it stays at 7; back to 4
spin K4 1
wait 200
expect loadset 2
expect bigring 1
said Load, set 2, Echospace 12
shot load_choose.png
spin K4 1
wait 200
expect loadset 4
said Load, set 4, Night Set
spin K4 1
wait 200
expect loadset 7
said Load, set 7, Three
spin K4 1
wait 200
expect loadset 7
spin K4 -1
wait 200
expect loadset 4
shot load_choose4.png
# resting on it: asked after 1.2 s, not before
wait 900
expect asking 0
wait 400
expect asking 48
setstate asking
said LOAD SET 4? Night Set. GLO yes, anything else no
shot load_ask.png
# no (HOME): nothing changes, HOME's page not opened
tap HOME
wait 100
setstate no
said LOAD SET 4 NOT LOADED
outis NOT LOADED
shot load_out_no.png
expect view 28
expectname 0 Basic
expect setlen 0
wait 3200
expect outcome 0
# a knob turned on and off again before the rest is up: asked only once it rests
spin K4 -1
wait 600
spin K4 1
wait 600
expect asking 0
spin K4 -1
wait 1300
expect asking 48
said LOAD SET 2? Echospace 12
# yes (GLO): loaded as from the computer: its five pieces into 1 to 5, its name on the page's line, saved
tap GLO
wait 600
setstate yes
said LOAD SET 2 LOADED
outis LOADED
shot load_out_yes.png
expect setlen 5
expect dirty 0
workcheck
wait 3200
expect outcome 0
expect view 28
said_none Load
tap HOME
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 600
said Set page, Echospace 12, 1 of 5, Basic: Mode Endless, Transition LP, only in Set mode, Store, set 2, Load, 3 sets stored
shot load_after.png
# it survives a reboot
reboot
wait 1000
expect setlen 5
tap PLAY
wait 400
expect playing 0
# the eight: loaded over it (Dawn its first)
tap GLO
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 600
spin K4 1
wait 1300
expect asking 48
said LOAD SET 2? Echospace 12
spin K4 1
wait 600
setstate no
said LOAD SET 2 NOT LOADED
wait 3200
spin K4 1
wait 200
expect loadset 4
wait 1300
tap GLO
wait 600
setstate yes
expect setlen 0
expectname 0 Dawn
wait 3200
# 30 s unanswered: no (NOT DONE, no answer in 30 s), the pieces as they were
spin K4 1
wait 1300
expect asking 48
wait 29000
expect asking 48
wait 1100
setstate timeout
said LOAD SET 7 NOT DONE: NO ANSWER
outis NOT DONE
shot load_out_timeout.png
expectname 0 Dawn
wait 3200
# a set coming in from the computer (BEGIN, no COMMIT yet): not loaded, the computer's transfer left as it is
sxreq 20 02050010FFFFFFFF 20
spin K4 -1
wait 1300
expect asking 0
outis NOT LOADED
said LOAD SET 4 NOT LOADED
shot load_out_busy.png
sxreq 24 - 24
wait 3200
# moved on before the rest is up (another page): nothing asked
spin K4 -1
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 1500
expect view 6
expect asking 0
expect outcome 0
tap GLO
wait 600
expect view 28
# playing: Load grey, a turn says STOP FIRST and asks nothing
tap PLAY
wait 600
expect playing 1
tap HOME
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 600
said Load, 3 sets stored, only when stopped
shot load_playing_rest.png
spin K4 1
wait 200
said Load, stop first: sets load only while stopped
msgis STOP FIRST
expect bigring 1
shot load_playing.png
wait 1500
expect asking 0
expect outcome 0
# the music started (MIDI) while it rests: STOP FIRST, nothing asked
tap PLAY
wait 600
expect playing 0
spin K4 -1
wait 200
midi FA
wait 1300
expect asking 0
outis STOP FIRST
said LOAD SET 2 STOP FIRST
shot load_out_playing.png
